OL,3,GNEWSASenior leaders at NHS Grampian
OL,4,Acriticised by health watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA healthcare watchdog has found "major
OL,7,Fdeficiencies" in the handling of the
OL,8,Fdeath of a patient during surgery,
OL,9,Ffollowing a damning report into
OL,10,Ffailures by senior leadership at NHS
OL,11,FGrampian.
OL,13,FHealthcare Improvement Scotland (HIS)
OL,14,Frevealed that a failure to learn from
OL,15,Fmistakes had caused "repeated and
OL,16,Favoidable harm" to patients.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
