OL,3,GNEWSASenior leaders at NHS Grampian
OL,4,Acriticised by health watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also said it had lost confidence in
OL,7,FNHS Grampian's management to deliver
OL,8,Freliable and consistent information
OL,9,Fafter it was ordered to halt all
OL,10,Fpaediatric surgery at Dr Gray's
OL,11,FHospital in Elgin but continued to
OL,12,Foperate on some children until early
OL,13,FAugust.
OL,15,FNHS Grampian chief executive Laura
OL,16,FSkaife-Knight said the board accepted
OL,17,Fthe findings and apologised to
OL,18,Fpatients.
